# The Dockerfile only needs requirements.txt: the repo is bind-mounted at
# /workspace when the container runs (scripts/train_all.sh, .devcontainer),
# so nothing else belongs in the build context. Without this, the daemon
# receives ~2.4 GB of checkpoints/, data/ and .git on every build.
#
# If the Dockerfile ever starts COPYing source, un-ignore it here too.
*
!requirements.txt
